        "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0A0D14 0%, #111827 50%, #1E293B 100%); border-left: 6px solid #FF3366; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 22px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(255, 51, 102, 0.15); border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 51, 102, 0.25); border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;\">\n    <div style=\"background: #FF3366; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 900; font-size: 16px; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 6px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 51, 102, 0.45); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, sans-serif;\">\n      NETRIS\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, sans-serif;\">\n        <span>FABRIC OBSERVABILITY</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size: 11px; background: rgba(0, 163, 255, 0.15); color: #00D2FF; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 163, 255, 0.35); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 600;\">MULTI-DATABASE EDITION</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 2px;\">\n        Unified Cross-Engine Fabric Observability &bull; Executive KPIs across Traffic, State &amp; Hardware\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n    <a href=\"/d/netris-fabric-overview\" style=\"text-decoration: none; background: #FF3366; color: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #FF3366; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 51, 102, 0.4);\">\ud83c\udfe0 Fabric Overview</a> <a href=\"/d/netris-graphite-telemetry\" style=\"text-decoration: none; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); color: #94A3B8; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; transition: all 0.2s;\">\ud83d\udcca Graphite Telemetry</a> <a href=\"/d/netris-mariadb-state\" style=\"text-decoration: none; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); color: #94A3B8; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; transition: all 0.2s;\">\ud83d\uddc4\ufe0f MariaDB State & SLA</a> <a href=\"/d/netris-mongodb-sensors\" style=\"text-decoration: none; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); color: #94A3B8; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; transition: all 0.2s;\">\ud83c\udf21\ufe0f MongoDB Sensors</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
